'''Growing Red''' (進化の赤マタタビ, ''Shinka no Aka Matabi'', '''Evolution Red Actinidia''') is the [[Catfruit]] gathering daily event of Wednesday. By clearing any of these stages, you might get a Red Catfruit, a Red Seed or an Epic Catfruit. You also have a small chance to unlock and play the special stage Catfruit Jubilee. This event was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

